area: model
case: 03-model-fetch-response
verification: explicit-divergence
oracle: python
projection: model
reason: the same coercion gap as model/01 on a different field: pydantic turns "200" into the int 200, the port's decoder refuses it. The refusal sentences themselves are not pinned (accepted difference: pydantic reports a structured error list, the port states one sentence).
